### Đăng ký

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"full_name": "Nguyen Van A",
"email": "a@gmail.com",
"phone": "0123456789",
"password": "Abc12345@"
}

### Đăng nhập

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "a@gmail.com",
"password": "Abc12345@"
}
